From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ilya Vysotsky <il.mohoff2016@yandex.ru>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 07:00:34 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] windows-sys: 32-bit ARM Windows (generated)

windows-sys has no ARM32 bindings: the layout gates, the *LongPtr aliases and
the architecture-specific types (CONTEXT, SLIST_HEADER, ...) are added.

Generated -- tools/patch-windows-rs-arm32.py makes every change here (and
the same for the windows crate outside the tree); on a newer Firefox, run
it again rather than applying this patch.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
